[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦……今天客人还真多。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在小卖铺门口发现了岛上孩子们的身影。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看上去非常热闹的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"跟在孩子们后面，向店里望了望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“师父！请看看这个值多少!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔――……50日元吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“好耶―――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“可恶――！T恤输掉了――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来是你――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10179"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哇哇!؟怎、怎么回事!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什么，原来是你……欢迎光临。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“欢迎光临个头啊。你这个骗子鉴定师。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10208"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“谁是骗子鉴定师啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我的T恤，就是你鉴定说只值30日元的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10205"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“T恤？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……上次那件啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“所以，那件衣服是你的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“30日元也太低了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“一般来说的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10344"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“男人穿过的T恤，你会出高价吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……出高价才可怕好吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然觉得那估价能接受了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“先不说这个……你让这些小孩叫你师父？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉？嗯，在教了他们一些事后自然而然就被这么叫――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10305"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……――喂，什么意思啊，你那副微妙地带着同情的眼神。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不、不用解释了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“身为人类，无论是谁总会有想要沉浸在优越感里的时候啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10208"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什……！简直像是在说我没有同龄的朋友一样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我特地避免了这种说法，居然自己说出口了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10121"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“火大――――――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然发现，小孩们都在盯着我看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“是守护者……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哦哦……你是那时候……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“队长！是守护者！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“可恶！是来夺回财宝的吗！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10270"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……守护者。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈！什么啊，你那微妙的像是在同情什么的眼神。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10272"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不用解释了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10333"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“身为人类，不管是谁总会有想要做不一样的自己的时候。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“才不是呢！我早就从那个时期毕业了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……估计你家里还留着的吧，笔记本之类的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……确实…还没来得及烧掉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊啊啊，要是给人发现了的话啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“师傅……！守护者他怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“开始抱着脑袋打滚了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10256"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这也是你们……，没错，将来的必经之路哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍抬头望向了远方的蓝天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，这鉴定是怎么玩的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“守护者，你恢复还真快啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是所谓的大人了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“哦哦哦，好帅啊，守护者。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“守护者，好厉害！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……求你们别叫我守护者了。太羞耻了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10184"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我说你啊，承受能力那么弱还去煽风点火……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10182"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这可不是游戏，是教育哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“就是说，不管什么东西都有其价值所在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，这岂不是都是按你的价值观来换算的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“没错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过我也算挺博学的，所以没问题！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鉴定指的是这回事吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我说，守护者。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就不能叫我大哥哥吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“那，大哥哥。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真听话，一会儿哥给你买个你喜欢的零食。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“太棒啦――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，什么事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“用鉴定来一决胜负吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“看我们和大哥哥谁捡到的东西更值钱！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“输掉的人请吃冰淇淋！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“通过胜负教导这世间的残酷，也是身为前辈的使命。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到时候可别哭丧着脸啊，臭小子们！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“什么叫哭丧着脸？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“大哥哥，不要说那么难懂的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“我们可还是小孩啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……抱歉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那，就由我来进行公平的鉴定吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“给小鬼们稍微放点水也没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我明白了，就听你的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……真的就稍微一点哦？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10210"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我说，你也太逊了吧……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"规则很简单。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从这座岛上找来更有价值的财宝的一方获胜。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10111"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好了，比赛开始！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“那就――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“开始寻宝――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“一攫千金！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍一声令下后，小孩们一下就从门口散开了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？你不去吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然要去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，漫无目的去找肯定赢不了他们。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"岛上的孩子们肯定要比我清楚岛上的哪里有什么东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以我不深思熟虑一番再行动的话，这场比赛肯定没希望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看上去像有宝藏的地方……我想想……”"},{"op":"set","variable":77,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到了海边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好了，财宝在哪呢……要是有什么漂流物就好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？那是什么？球？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"靠近一看……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不对！这是……青蛙؟!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个用塑料做成的球状青蛙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可从来没见过这东西……肯定是宝物了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“赢定了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我找到的是一条完整的蛇蜕下来的皮！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哼……我的是在海边发现的奇怪青蛙！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦？大家都没感到惊奇……？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10272"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……那么，我来进行判定。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这场比赛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是蛇皮获胜！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“太好了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？这只青蛙你不觉得很稀奇吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“一点都不。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“浮蛙的话，在岛上到处都能见到。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没想到居然是常见的东西……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“而且，据说把蛇蜕掉的皮放进钱包里，就能赚到更多的钱哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“太好了！发大财了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可恶……看来只能承认是我输了……”"},{"op":"set","variable":78,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i40"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"山里应该会有不少稀奇的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"植物也好，昆虫也好……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等，这是!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是锹甲！好像是第一次亲眼见到！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我记得……这是被称为黑钻石的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“名副其实的宝贝啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以说是已经胜券在握。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“欢迎回来。看来你找到了满意的宝物呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“差不多吧，请原谅略显不成熟的我吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10194"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“总之先让我看看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我的是大锹甲！超过80mm呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等!؟呃？好大！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……那个……我的也是…锹甲……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“那么小！大哥哥的好小啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“小锹甲吗。是到处都有的普通锹甲哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“价值呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10272"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“几乎没有。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“所以，是大锹甲获胜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“虽说大哥哥的很小，但别介意啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“别一口一个小了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……很伤人的。”"},{"op":"set","variable":79,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i21"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里是男人们的秘密基地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么藏着一两个宝物也不奇怪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话是这么说，翻个遍也很失礼啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这里就顺我的第六感挑一个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……就是这里！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i209"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"指尖碰到了一本书。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":236,"value":["==",["native","エサを過去に手に入れたことがある"],0]},{"op":"goto","target":236},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i21"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呵……这还真是够赞的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是良一还是天善的喜好呢？真不错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔唔……唔唔唔唔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“呜……丢弃在港口的钓竿……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……看来形势有些不利呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没能找到。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10258"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？是吗？那就是你的不战而败了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊，没办法。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“太……太好了！我赢了!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哼……开心成这样。还真是小屁孩。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为什么你明明输了却一脸满足呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个嘛……因为我是个大人，吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10316"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“虽然不知道你在说什么，不过说实话很恶心唉。”"},{"op":"set","variable":80,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“灯塔也就是放出光芒的高塔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么藏着一两个宝贝也不奇怪。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然我这么想……不过竟然是什么都没有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？那是什么……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个像是……帽子一样的东西随风飘落……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不对……这，这是！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是帽子……而是巨大的……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无比巨大的胸罩！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……让人兴奋啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还是第一次摸到这样的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“难道说……这就是上天赐予的礼物吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“让我用这个去赢下比赛……的意思是吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我将胸罩塞进了口袋里，慌慌张张离开了灯塔。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我找到的是，修修还能用的收音机！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……过来过来……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在小孩子眼前拿出来感觉还是不太好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……借一步说话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“到底是什么呀……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10172"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（你看，怎么样？）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10139"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"（……!!؟）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10247"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"（……这、这是谁的啊？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（天知道。）"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10209"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":" “快给我还回去―――――！” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是、是！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10205"},{"op":"set","variable":81,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这地方人来人往的，应该会有不少宝贝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有什么可以带过去的呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还要有点价值才行……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯？那是……钱包？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇！里面还有成捆的纸币！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……糟糕……只是拿在手里人就在发抖了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“得快点交到港口的接待处才行……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，等等……现在还在比赛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“（咽口水）……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“爸……爸爸的私房钱！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有、有大笔现金的钱包！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你们啊……明明比的是东西的价值，直接拿钱过来是几个意思啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10261"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“等等，这笔巨款是怎么回事！还是扎成捆的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那什么，比完了吗？我想快点交还给港口去！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我，我也是！被爸爸发现前我得还回去！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10249"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这次算平局！你们快给我还回去！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“是――――！”"},{"op":"set","variable":82,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i58"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘿嘿……说到宝贝的话当然是老规矩，肯定沉睡在老旧的仓库里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我倒要看看苍的眼光有多么毒辣。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好了，有些什么呢～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i76"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么……这种……好像被呼唤着一般的感觉――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗡嗡……嗡嗡……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这是…壶？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么呢，看上去很普通……却有种不祥的感觉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是那种不干净的东西吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不……正因为如此才有价值吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“我在海边抓到的招潮蟹！左边的钳子特别大！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这很少见吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“多少有点。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10154"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“然后，你的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我嘛……这个，怎么说呢……像是被诅咒了的壶。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10249"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……这个……很麻烦的东西啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很糟吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“现在立刻还回去，然后在壶前面撒上盐堆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……呃…比赛怎么算？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“快！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是！”"},{"op":"set","variable":83,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"神社吗……某种意义上就像是集结了岛上历史的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一定会有不少值钱货沉睡于此。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比如这只石狮子狗，看上去值不少钱呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过太重了，带不走。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抽签抽到少见的签的话，会算我赢吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"沉思着在神社内徘徊了一会儿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？这是什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细一看，在社殿旁边有一扇小门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"估计是小猫小狗用的小门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且门上贴着一张古老的符纸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……有种不能揭下它的感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉这张符纸，是绝对不能揭下的！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要是揭下来的话，岛上似乎会发生不得了的事情！”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“好了，快点给我看看你们找到的宝贝吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我的是家里找到的符纸！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……勅令陏身保命…，还真是怀念呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“用来控制僵尸的灵符的复制品。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“然后，你的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……找到的是这座岛的和平……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10213"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“根本听不懂你在说什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没关系的。是我输了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是吗？那么，是僵尸灵符的胜利。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“太好了――――！爽――――!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，这样就好……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样就可以了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为，我保护住了这座岛……"},{"op":"set","variable":84,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"几乎没有人来＝那些小孩也不会来＝有未知的宝物在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想的应该没错才对……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到底会有什么呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……？这，这是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"地上掉着个罐头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很轻呢……里面有什么吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不……！不对！这是！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是这个了……赢定了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦？还真是自信十足的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真不好意思……居然对小孩子使出了全力。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是吗，那就快让我看看你们找到的宝贝吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我找到的是个叫信长的人？所用过的茶盏！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“给我等等。你到底是在哪找到的啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“听说是我家代代相传的家宝。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“确实，盏底写着信长呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……用片假名。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呵呵……感动全岛啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“然后，你的呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我找到的是，这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“充满巴黎空气的罐头。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“身在日本却能享受到外国的空气……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你能理解其蕴含的价值吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“可恶……！巴黎也太强了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“看来是羽依里赢了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“来，让我们享受下胜利的滋味吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔啪……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没感觉有什么特别的啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“巴黎的空气没了――――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯，羽依里输了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉؟!为什么؟!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“毕竟，打开的话，就和岛上的空气混在一起了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“也就没价值啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"set","variable":85,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i18"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然是那些小孩的主场，但这才是盲点所在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要是用从这里找到的东西赢下这场比赛的话，他们也会心服口服吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我所追求的是超越胜利的，完胜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而这里，应该就有我所追求的东西……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"悉悉索索……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哼哼……找到了，白色的宝石。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那么，让我看看你们找到的宝贝。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，就先从我的开始好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看吧！在泳池里找到的白色宝石！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊啊，女生是没办法理解这东西的价值呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们的话应该能理解吧!؟发现这个时兴奋起来的感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“这是沉在泳池底的东西吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“这东西很伤手，不能拿手碰哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……乡下还真是冷漠……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那你们又找到了什么东西呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“看上去很好看的石头。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂喂，还真够随便的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“里面还有虫子在。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，这叫琥珀，是树脂的化石哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“可以直接拿去卖了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“真真正正的宝石哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我，我认为东西的价值……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是单纯能用金钱来衡量的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而是……要看对人的内心产生多少冲击才对。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这琥珀里的虫子，看上去像是远古时代的蜜蜂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“冲击心灵的浪漫！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“耶――！赢了！”"},{"op":"set","variable":86,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10279"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“怎么样？还继续吗？”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":568,"value":["==",["v",6042],2]},{"op":"goto","target":612},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"继续","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"认输","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":591,"value":["&&",["==",["v",6001],0],["==",["v",6042],0]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谁会认输啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“大哥哥，别怪我们让你哭丧着脸哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我们可不会手下留情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“别小看小孩子了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“刚才你们还说不知道哭丧着脸的意思吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“感觉很帅就先用上了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嘛，反正也是无谓的挣扎。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么还没开始就摆出胜负已定的样子？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10303"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你想太多啦。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6042,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"return"},{"op":"goto","target":612},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":612,"value":["&&",["==",["v",6001],0],["==",["v",6042],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还没结束呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“可笑！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“好好掂量下自己的斤两吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“太放肆了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么啊这些小鬼，得意忘形得过头了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10252"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“还真是不见黄河心不死呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以说，为什么还没开始就摆出胜负已定的样子啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说了是你想太多啦。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6042,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"return"},{"op":"goto","target":612},{"op":"set","variable":6042,"value":["neg",1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，是我输了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“太好了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“快请客冰淇淋啦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，喜欢什么随便你们选吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“耶！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小鬼们围着冰柜，开始挑选各自喜欢的冷饮。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“我要这个！还有这个和这个！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我要这个和这个！那个也要！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“我要这个和这个和这个和这个和――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等下小鬼们。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“唉，你不是说随便我们选的嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是随便你们选的，是随便选你们喜欢的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“我喜欢这个和这个还有这个啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎哟，盯着合同漏洞来解释吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“难道大哥哥连这点出息都没？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“随便选好了，你们这群小混蛋！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“欧耶――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“欧耶――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“欧耶――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“真的可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“反正说要一决胜负的时候，估计就已经是注定是我请客了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10227"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？我说错了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就算我找到了很厉害的东西过来，你也打算让他们赢的不是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10189"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“才、才……才没有…呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，我并没有生气。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也觉得这样挺好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样他们也会比较开心吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10182"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10184"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“难不成，你其实是个好人？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也希望自己是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“下次再见，大哥哥！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“再一起玩啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“下次，大家一起去寻宝吧！约好了哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好啊。再见。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"很开心地挥着手，小孩们离开了小卖铺。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“看来他们很喜欢你呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“小孩子有那么好哄来着？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“天真无邪啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“往好了就是这样吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我还是觉得，你是个好人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10194"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为了输掉特地找了奇奇怪怪的东西来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这样的，我觉得有点帅。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………当然了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……你这沉默是？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“难不成，其实你挺来劲的……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………才不是呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“所以你这沉默是怎么回事呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唔……呜呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10258"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“真的很不甘心吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“才……才没有不……甘心……呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉，没想到你还挺小孩子气的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我这叫天真无邪！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这才叫硬往好了说吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍无可奈何地叹了口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，感觉她朝向我的目光似乎温柔了几分。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]